{
  "_comment": [
    "Every amenity value in use, with the category it sits under and the icon it",
    "gets on a project page. Structural only -- the visible label is the amenity",
    "string itself, translated in content/i18n/amenities.json, so nothing here",
    "needs a translation.",
    "",
    "Derived by keyword rules and then read. The rules went wrong twice before",
    "this file was written: an unbounded 'spa' matched 'parking spaces' and",
    "'coworking space' and filed nine of them under wellness, and 'thermal'",
    "caught 'aerothermal hot water'. Both are why the rules are not kept and this",
    "file is: a wrong entry is now one line to fix rather than a regex to re-reason.",
    "",
    "audit_site_consistency checks that every amenity a project lists has an entry",
    "here, so a new one cannot reach a page uncategorised."
  ],
